From 359afe7b69207b4b6b058f2b1811061530d8d968 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Benjamin Glatzel <begla@intrinsic-engine.com>
Date: Sun, 21 May 2017 12:53:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Rewrote GPU memory allocation scheme - more flexible and
 should be able to deal with more complex GPU memory heap setups

* Switched from a "global pool" based system to a page allocation scheme
for each pool type supporting pages per pool from different GPU heaps
* Addresses #32
