 .../src/IntrinsicRendererVulkanEnumsStructs.h      |  20 +-
 .../IntrinsicRendererVulkanGpuMemoryManager.cpp    | 255 +++++++++------------
 .../src/IntrinsicRendererVulkanGpuMemoryManager.h  |  84 +++----
 .../src/IntrinsicRendererVulkanRenderSystem.cpp    |   4 +-
